{'symbol': 'PNC', 'date': '2022-10-03 16:43:00', 'title': 'HARRIS WILLIAMS ADVISES DENALI INGREDIENTS ON ITS PENDING SALE TO ORKLA FOOD INGREDIENTS, A SUBSIDIARY OF ORKLA ASA', 'text': 'RICHMOND, VA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HARRIS WILLIAMS, A GLOBAL INVESTMENT BANK SPECIALIZING IN M&A ADVISORY SERVICES, ANNOUNCES IT IS ADVISING DENALI INGREDIENTS, A PRIVATELY HELD, FAMILY-OWNED COMPANY, ON ITS PENDING SALE TO ORKLA FOOD INGREDIENTS (OFI), A BUSINESS AREA OF ORKLA ASA (ORKLA). DENALI INGREDIENTS IS A LEADING PROVIDER OF CUSTOM SPECIALTY INGREDIENTS FOR THE ICE CREAM AND FROZEN NOVELTY INDUSTRY. THE TRANSACTION IS BEING LED BY BRANT CASH, ANDY WARCZAK AND CAM CORNWELL OF THE HARRI'}{'symbol': 'PNC', 'date': '2022-10-03 11:10:00', 'title': 'PNC DECLARES DIVIDEND OF $1.50 ON COMMON STOCK', 'text': 'PITTSBURGH , OCT. 3, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF THE PNC FINANCIAL SERVICES GROUP, INC. (NYSE: PNC) DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND ON THE COMMON STOCK OF $1.50 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND, WITH A PAYMENT DATE OF NOV. 5, 2022, WILL BE PAYABLE THE NEXT BUSINESS DAY TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS OCT. 17, 2022.'}